# Purpose

This document serves as the master architecture index for the BestWayGrow Franchise subsystem.

The Franchise Architecture defines the complete structure for franchise operations, including franchise application, approval workflow, dashboard operations, financial management, inventory management, security controls, service dependencies, and execution lifecycle.

The purpose of this index is to provide a centralized navigation point for all Franchise Architecture documents.

---

# Architecture Scope

The Franchise subsystem manages:

- Franchise Application
- Franchise Approval
- Franchise Account Management
- Franchise Dashboard
- Franchise Bank Integration
- PIN Stock Management
- Product Stock Management
- Order Management
- Transaction Monitoring
- Financial Reporting
- Security Control
- Audit Tracking

